        "note_tweet": {
          "text": "Cybersecurity company Corma has raised $125M at a $1B valuation in a Series A led by NEA.\n\nThe company’s main product, Corma Cyber Defense, is a purpose-built foundation model for defensive cybersecurity, including threat detection, triage, investigation, and incident response.\n\nIt can connect to Slack or Microsoft Teams and be deployed in the cloud and on-premises for organizations with tight data sovereignty requirements."
